{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj48o7xRZDa9h8psLjgA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before a plain, heavy door. There is a single keyhole, tarnished brass, at its center. The door says nothing. It waits.*\n\n*A faint draft breathes through the keyhole — cold, carrying the scent of something old and forgotten.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you like an eye.*\n\n🔒\n\n*Do you have the key?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":87,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}